From 2ce59c1337751f2ee901d7b3f42738cef8741825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tommy Steimel <steimel@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:22:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 27/32] [AutoPiP] Only allow auto picture-in-picture from
 primary main frame

Ensure that MediaSessionImpl only exposes kEnterAutoPictureInPicture
and routes EnterAutoPictureInPicture() when the routed
MediaSessionService is in the primary main frame.

Also ensure AutoPictureInPictureTabHelper checks
GetPrimaryMainRoutedFrame() in IsEligibleForAutoPictureInPicture()
(covering the camera/microphone path), at the start of
MeetsMediaEngagementConditions(), and unconditionally in
ScheduleUrlSafetyCheck().

Bug: 575048405
Change-Id: I8437e9f5b8237ebeff2369967ed9089a997bdd54
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8615561
Reviewed-by: Benjamin Keen <bkeen@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Tommy Steimel <steimel@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1723940}
